{
  "id": "36-settle-naive-greedy-not-optimal",
  "description": "Balances -3000, -2000, +4000, +3000, -2000. Splits into two zero-sum groups {Alice,Dave} and {Bob,Carol,Erin}, so 3 payments suffice. Naively paying the biggest debtor to the biggest creditor takes 4. (One synthetic expense is used to hit exactly these balances.)",
